We are committed to providing for the needs of homeless and owned dogs and cats in our community. Serving[ over] 5,000 companion animals annually through direct intervention and many more through[ advocacy], we continue to promote the humane values of protection, care, and[ compassion] for all living things.
The Delaware SPCA is dedicated to the prevention of cruelty and the encouragement of humane treatment of all animals. Established in 1873, Delaware SPCA is the oldest animal welfare organization in the state and has provided continuous service to pets and their[ companions] for more than 135 years.
